        "original_id": "a1c11320-26ff-52f1-8af1-a5631a634813",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Inga Bejer Engh, Svein Holden, Anders Behring Breivik\n- Events: 2011 Norway attacks, 2012 Breivik trial\n- Places: Oslo, Regjeringskvartalet, Utøya\n- Organizations: Workers' Youth League (AUF)\n\nFacts:\n- On 22 July 2011, Anders Behring Breivik killed eight people by detonating a van bomb at Regjeringskvartalet in Oslo.\n- On 22 July 2011, Anders Behring Breivik then shot dead 69 participants of a Workers' Youth League (AUF) summer camp on the island of Utøya.\n- In 2012, Inga Bejer Engh and prosecutor Svein Holden prosecuted terror suspect Anders Behring Breivik in the trial following the 2011 Norway attacks.",
